**Here are some specific questions you can ask your doctor:**

* **Regarding your labs:** *"Could you clarify my recent lab results from Seton Medical Center? I have a reading of 138/88 listed as TSH, but I suspect this might be my blood pressure. What was my actual TSH, and what was my recent HbA1c reading?"*
