* **Regarding the MRI and joint pain:** *"Could you clarify the primary purpose of the MRI my GP ordered? Is it to investigate my frequent joint pain?"*
* **Regarding your referral:** *"Can we discuss the referral to Seattle Heart? How does this relate to my shortness of breath or my other current symptoms?"*

